Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.93,0:22:54.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}沙粒一点一点
